## Pre-existing unrelated noise present on BOTH branches (not a regression of this fix)
production.ERROR: [FAIL] OpenTelemetry export failed (telemetry batch dropped) --
cURL error 7 connecting to localhost:5080 (OpenObserve is not running on this host).
Because SetRequestId shares log context, these lines DO carry a correlation_id, so a literal
read of AC3 ('no ERROR correlated to a captured X-Request-Id') would fail on both branches.
Scoped to the cache/deadlock error shape, AC3 passes on the fix and fails on the baseline.
